### Register GitHub MCP
POST http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/tools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "GitHub",
  "transport": "STREAMABLE_HTTP",
  "endpoint": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/",
  "authType": "BEARER",
  "secret": "YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN",
  "enabled": true
}


### Get all MCP tools
GET http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/tools


### Get GitHub MCP tool
GET http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/tools/1